    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm just worried about it being a bit of a gray area in practice. if they see something suspiciously similar in another codebase, how do they even prove it wasn't just 'residual memory' vs them actually stealing their IP? it feels like a messy situation to be in if things go south.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
